<translate>
==== EjectAmmoStopSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. The parameter specifies the sound that will be played when the weapon is unloaded.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
EjectAmmoStopSound = DoubleBarrelShotgunEjectAmmoStop,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

